## Objective
1. To understand and implement a singly linked list in C++.
2. To create a menu-driven student record management system.
3. To add new student records dynamically.
4. To search for student records using roll numbers.
5. To display all student records stored in the linked list.
6. To delete a student record from the linked list.
7. To perform insertion and deletion using dynamic memory allocation.
8. To manage student records efficiently and systematically.
